This product includes original code licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

It bundles and builds upon third-party material from MT-JailBench
("MT-JailBench: A benchmark framework for studying multi-turn jailbreak
attacks", SafetyArena, arXiv:2605.11002), pinned at commit
cb8184e0a9ad7a65c86a00e2a38c57a5f58043f0. MT-JailBench is redistributed under
the MIT License ("The MT-JailBench Authors", 2026); the upstream license text
is preserved verbatim in LICENSES/mt-jailbench-MIT.txt.

The technique (X-Teaming, strategy-driven multi-turn attack with TextGrad
refinement) is credited to its original authors; MT-JailBench's implementation
is the direct upstream ported here.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled material (vendored byte-for-byte; sha256-pinned in _vendor/SHA256SUMS)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- _vendor/mtjb/engine/attacks/xteaming/prompts/attacker_agent_prompts.yaml
- _vendor/mtjb/engine/attacks/xteaming/prompts/evaluation_prompt.yaml
- _vendor/mtjb/engine/attacks/xteaming/prompts/plan_generation_prompts.yaml
    Strategy-generation, per-turn attacker, and judge prompt templates.
- _vendor/mtjb/engine/attacks/xteaming/updater_utils.py
    Holds XTEAMING_SCORING_POLICY (read verbatim for the TextGrad loss).
- _vendor/mtjb/engine/attacks/xteaming/xteaming_prompt_generator.py
    Holds TEXTGRAD_LOSS_TEMPLATE (read verbatim for the TextGrad loss).

The strategy/turn/judge/flow logic is reimplemented from scratch in
src/mtjb_xteaming_optimizer/ (original to this module, MIT). No prompt/dataset
body is reproduced in authored code.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party runtime dependencies (optional, referenced by name only)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- textgrad (MIT) and tiktoken (MIT) power the optional refine path; they are not
  bundled and are pulled from PyPI only when the `refine` extra is installed.

